cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Zdisplay
message: If you reference this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: zuunypro
    website: 'https://github.com/zuunypro'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/zuunypro/zdisplay'
url: 'https://zuuny.vercel.app/programas/zdisplay'
abstract: >-
  A Windows tray application that controls brightness, contrast, saturation,
  digital vibrance, gamma, color temperature, hue, blue light reduction and
  near-black shadow detail from a single program. It selects among GDI gamma
  ramp, Magnification color matrix, NVAPI, ADL, DDC/CI, SDR white level and WMI
  backlight backends according to what each machine supports, and reports per
  monitor which control is available and why one is not. Profiles switch
  automatically by foreground application or by a schedule that accepts
  sunrise- and sunset-relative times. Written in C++17 against the Win32 API
  with no framework or runtime.
keywords:
  - windows
  - display
  - color-management
  - black-equalizer
  - shadow-detail
  - digital-vibrance
  - gamma-ramp
